    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Corporate Actions Entitlement Calculator & Deadline Tracker\n\nAutomated n8n workflow for processing mandatory and voluntary Corporate Action event notices (ISO 20022: DVCA, DVSE, SPLF, RHTS, TEND, CHOS). Calculates position entitlements, tracks election deadlines, drafts client notification emails, and records audit logs.\n\n### Setup Instructions\n1. **Webhook Security**: Set `X-Webhook-Secret` header in your request to match `$env.WEBHOOK_SECRET`.\n2. **Google Sheets**: Connect Google Sheets OAuth to read `PositionBook` and append to `AuditTrail`.\n3. **OpenAI Credentials**: Connect OpenAI credential for notification drafting.",
        "height": 376,
        "width": 684,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "d8a0f4d9-474d-4eeb-8e75-2f727ab51975",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        32,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Webhook Ingestion & Validation\n- Listens for incoming ISO 20022 payloads at `POST /ca-notification`.\n- Validates required parameters (`eventId`, `isin`, `eventType`, `recordDate`).\n- Checks election deadline formatting for voluntary events (`VOLU`/`CHOS`).",
        "height": 356,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5a855cdd-b168-4317-8b8e-636cdde079fe",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Ingestion & Validation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        16,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Position Lookup & Merge\n- Queries Google Sheets `PositionBook` sheet by `isin`.\n- Combines settled position details with event data.",
        "height": 372,
        "width": 376,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "1ecef76b-bb1d-4b83-9022-1618d47e7dbb",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Position Lookup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Event Calculation Engine\nExecutes calculation logic based on `eventType`:\n- **DVCA**: Cash Dividend = `position * grossRate` (rounded to 2 decimal places)\n- **DVSE**: Stock Dividend & Fractional Cash\n- **SPLF**: Stock Split ratio calculation\n- **RHTS**: Rights Issue entitlement\n- **TEND/CHOS**: Voluntary Tender/Choice position booking",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "f873db15-7cb6-4c13-8f91-0fc77798dd45",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Calculation Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        -48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Deadline & Priority Calculation\nCalculates days remaining for voluntary elections:\n- **INFORMATIONAL**: >10 days\n- **REMINDER**: 3 to 10 days\n- **URGENT**: 1 to 3 days\n- **BREACH**: Passed deadline",
        "height": 676,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "d669d5d2-3c5b-4abe-94bc-d0bd12141154",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Deadline Priority",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1472,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 5. Client Email Drafting (OpenAI)\n- Generates notification draft for account holders.\n- Prompt template locks financial figures to ensure exact figures are preserved.",
        "height": 668,
        "width": 288,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "ab7c4c01-5168-4573-a551-74f13c84ce95",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Email Drafting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1728,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 6. Dispatch & Audit Trail\n- **Gmail**: Sends notification email to client.\n- **Audit Log**: Appends record to `AuditTrail` sheet.",
